# Memory-mapped LoadShape fixtures: byte layout is load-bearing (the MMF reader
# indexes by fixed record/line width), and the oracle-validated fingerprint in
# manifest.note was computed from these exact bytes. Never apply EOL/other
# normalization (core.autocrlf is on in this repo), so they stay byte-identical
# on every platform — LF-only text, raw binary floats.
mm8.sng -text
mm8.dbl -text
mmpq8.csv -text
shape_mmf.dss -text
